      "timestamp_minutes": 15.0,
      "type": "reassess",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "MANDATORY action - Must attach defibrillator pads immediately to identify cardiac rhythm (VF/pVT vs asystole/PEA) which dictates whether defibrillation or epinephrine-first approach is indicated per ACLS guidelines."
    },
    {
      "action_id": "analyze_rhythm",
      "timestamp_minutes": 20.0,
      "type": "reassess",
      "args": {},
      "justification": "After attaching pads, rhythm analysis is immediately required to determine if rhythm is shockable (VF/pVT \u2192 defibrillation) or non-shockable (asystole/PEA \u2192 epinephrine + reversible causes), guiding all subsequent ACLS interventions."
    },
    {
      "action_id": "apply_end_tidal_co2_monitoring",
      "timestamp_minutes": 25.0,
